{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_024_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d0862cf9269b52d74617ea1c7afd3b5f92c01ba92dcddc670f617c9e3272eadc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45cddaf2e8d19bf299d1f2d92844ce8f37c5dbc83cb02d90cab4d7f66f77ecd6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n白色情人节快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cf2e805a040413079320773affa7376d7948a26d346e62b4e5b6b89dbfcff10",
      "text": "当然没有忘记吧？\n之前不是约好了要送你回礼嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346b327c07aa936aaaa68fd4a92987f983376a0fd0a060a0423c95e1a99be843",
      "text": "所以呢……给，请收下！\n是我送的礼物哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282fe4f49d698242aaa6316bbf823a810270d4056c80102694052ee331f5ab9c",
      "text": "为了●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n我可是鼓足干劲挑选的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7328b52b2f438de737be707ee421cda70154c3022f3fa07ec63d6942c618af",
      "text": "想看到你高兴的表情，希望你快点拆开呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02db3971d14ef502cf433046d43ad3f1068050e0fa89bb445e93c74fc0c39edd",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n现在稍微方便聊会儿天吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a57ced21f2b9a06d96b5684cb7e75681ae9530ce4fb47d0a96b5358ae424203b",
      "text": "锵锵——！白色情人节快乐！\n这是情人节的回礼哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d8be746e7e68dfbcf24c7dd5215a850b3a418dcf52682dc9839d9311bf4ebd",
      "text": "给●●●●プロデューサー酱\n送什么礼物，我超——级纠结的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f00f5965cc7dea2e92fade9255080e882bf0679ea478ae315db02f86d9a2ce2d",
      "text": "毕竟无论如何都想让你开心嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4077eed7494bdfea68d19e5d39d4a37e90decf43ef8d610d9621ca53fd00349",
      "text": "平时一直承蒙关照，必须十倍奉还才行！\n虽然一开始是这么想的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f823d40ff95e93443c58874d25303d5ce351d1aa575630a934d877c7e453e2",
      "text": "可一真挑起来，眼睛就被各种各样的东西\n给吸引住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1ccf295bdbcbffe8ca844acd3efc96f285637b9f689ae1b547b441e5a10bf77",
      "text": "但是但是，看到这个的时候我一下就来电了！\n绝对非这个莫属！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000053:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000054:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ae3becf00ad3f602ecab0e44ff33826e1f2e56ce075423fe1fb730c75d1f60",
      "text": "真的吗？好期待呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27014cd2af8b04154fdb9c8ae8b17879082704a2f11554866fe48f8ec244a60a",
      "text": "呼呼呼，我超级有自信的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c7a61f57c09ff844f5fb2d4d5d36fdd00f48503f020e798cef1f33dc8dd6d74",
      "text": "快快，华丽丽地拆开吧，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_22:5_02_024_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f198fccf708d504944fa552572c974aaf8d3f6a79a2817b68730f1ffc56bc2d",
      "text": "真的绝对绝对会合你心意的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
